		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1be81b35-3f1f-5277-afc8-e3f2331fa88b")
	)
	(text "Gain 1 + 14.7 k / 10.0 k = 2.47 (0.1 % resistors): DAC full scale 4.095 V gives 10.11 V; firmware calibrates the 0 V and 10 V points of each channel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1d024059-6127-53f2-bd68-6e78be1d856d")
	)
	(text "Output 100 R inside the feedback loop, SMAJ15A and 10 nF to AGND. At 10 V into 2 k the op-amp swings to 10.6 V, below its 13.5 V limit on 15 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5948895c-6496-5927-adf0-51dd27b36fb8")
	)
	(text "Design notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71d4cad9-853f-5aac-b6df-05567d8f239a")
	)
	(text "Accuracy after calibration: reference drift 125 ppm/C x 55 C = 0.7 %, offset 3 mV = 0.03 %, resistors 0.2 %: about +/-0.9 % FS worst case over 0 to 80 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "889f1d83-b4f9-5c8a-a19c-ec972c0fec33")
	)
	(text "LOGIC (GND_L)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 67.31 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c2c1e0c-a6df-5129-9534-0230bd37751c")
	)
	(text "CA-IS3740HW outputs default high: CS_A high deselects the DAC and CLAMP_A high turns the clamp MOSFET on, so both outputs sit at 0 V at power-up and when logic power is lost."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c9aad0e8-7106-5af8-93c6-ea39829cc2f8")
	)
	(text "SPI and the clamp signal pass a CA-IS3740HW (default high: DAC deselected, outputs clamped) to an MCP4822 on +5V_A (78L05 from +15V_A). A clamp MOSFET holds both op-amp inputs at AGND until firmware releases AO_CLAMP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d7abefc3-6306-55cc-bc12-0fa52c1c7326")
	)
